{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1764125,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"blue_un","paid":0,"title":"Campus Rise: TechMind Challenge 2026","festival_id":null,"organization_id":941564,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-03T12:01:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-11-03T23:59:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"quizzes","public_url":"quiz\/campus-rise-techmind-challenge-2026-viva-college-of-arts-commerce-and-science-1764125","region":"online","details":"<p><strong>Overview<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Test Your Knowledge. Challenge Yourself. Rise to the Top!<\/p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"439\" data-end=\"479\">Campus Rise: TechMind Challenge 2026<\/strong> is an online <strong data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"522\">MCQ-based technology quiz<\/strong> designed to test participants' knowledge of <strong data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"684\">Information Technology, Computer Science, Programming, Data Science, AI\/ML, and other emerging technology domains<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p>The challenge features <strong data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"742\">30 multiple-choice questions<\/strong> covering a diverse range of technical topics, from fundamental concepts to problem-solving and industry-relevant knowledge.<\/p>\n<p>Whether you are a <strong data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"994\">Computer Science, Information Technology, Data Science, AI\/ML, Computer Applications, or related student<\/strong>, this challenge provides an opportunity to assess your technical knowledge, compete with fellow learners, and strengthen your understanding of core technology concepts.<\/p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"3165\" data-end=\"3218\">Join the official Campus Rise WhatsApp Community:<\/strong><br data-start=\"3218\" data-end=\"3221\" \/><a href=\"https:\/\/chat.whatsapp.com\/E85adW0fCZ7Ij8k8m0bwvx\">https:\/\/chat.whatsapp.com\/E85adW0fCZ7Ij8k8m0bwvx<\/a><\/p>\n<p><strong>What to Expect?<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Participants will attempt <strong data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1237\">30 MCQ-based questions<\/strong> covering multiple areas of technology. The questions are designed to evaluate:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1531\">\n<li data-section-id=\"n16wwu\" data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1368\">Technical knowledge and conceptual understanding<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"xejujc\" data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1409\">Programming and problem-solving skills<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1n3sjbo\" data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1454\">Knowledge of computer science fundamentals<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"aefpoa\" data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1493\">Understanding of modern technologies<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ph2ix1\" data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1531\">Ability to apply technical concepts<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Topics Covered<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>The quiz may include questions from the following domains:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1888\">\n<li data-section-id=\"brr7f\" data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1635\">Computer Fundamentals<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"aa6c8c\" data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1667\">Programming &amp; Coding Concepts<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1cv2wkk\" data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1698\">Data Structures &amp; Algorithms<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1wigi8h\" data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1735\">Database Management Systems (DBMS)<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1qkxkfs\" data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1754\">Web Technologies<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"106dv4c\" data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1799\">Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1qonj7w\" data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1814\">Data Science<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1kh1pft\" data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1832\">Cloud Computing<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1b3zhwx\" data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1848\">Cybersecurity<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1jpt43n\" data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1868\">Operating Systems<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1kummaq\" data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1888\">Computer Networks<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Event Highlights<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"2440\">\n<li data-section-id=\"tzs4ph\" data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1939\"><strong data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"1939\">30 MCQ-based questions<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1x340r\" data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"1976\">Multiple technology and IT domains<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ceoqvy\" data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"1999\">Online participation<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"dvzce9\" data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2057\">Open to students from technical and related backgrounds<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"apisva\" data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2103\">Opportunity to compete with fellow learners<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1akiliu\" data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2159\"><strong data-start=\"2106\" data-end=\"2159\">Top 3 performers will receive special recognition<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"sc1mp2\" data-start=\"2160\" data-end=\"2214\">Rank 1 will receive a <strong data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2214\">Special Winner Certificate<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1c0blaz\" data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2275\">Rank 2 and Rank 3 will receive <strong data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2275\">Top Ranker Certificates<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"vyabrt\" data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2344\">Eligible participants will receive a <strong data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2344\">Participation Certificate<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"11ytr51\" data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2440\">Event updates and important announcements through the official Campus Rise WhatsApp Community<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Eligibility<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>The challenge is open to:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2773\">\n<li data-section-id=\"gf53dt\" data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2512\">Computer Science students<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"y02ec8\" data-start=\"2513\" data-end=\"2546\">Information Technology students<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"950kba\" data-start=\"2547\" data-end=\"2570\">Data Science students<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ugzhjo\" data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2587\">AI\/ML students<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"18bwda4\" data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"2620\">Computer Applications students<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ra5ppv\" data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2657\">Engineering and technical students<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1tux2hg\" data-start=\"2658\" data-end=\"2710\">Students from other related technology backgrounds<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ffatz9\" data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2773\">Technology enthusiasts interested in testing their knowledge<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong data-start=\"2775\" data-end=\"2807\">Participation is individual.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>WhatsApp Community &ndash; Mandatory<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>After registering for the event, participants <strong data-start=\"2890\" data-end=\"2947\">must join the official Campus Rise WhatsApp Community<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p>All important event-related information will be communicated through the community, including:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3046\" data-end=\"3163\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1lj3qs6\" data-start=\"3046\" data-end=\"3067\">Event announcements<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"elmp6t\" data-start=\"3068\" data-end=\"3092\">Important instructions<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1pgq1p9\" data-start=\"3093\" data-end=\"3107\">Quiz updates<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"uw635h\" data-start=\"3108\" data-end=\"3119\">Reminders<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"jv0awi\" data-start=\"3120\" data-end=\"3129\">Results<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"p4dtsj\" data-start=\"3130\" data-end=\"3163\">Certificate-related information<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong data-start=\"3165\" data-end=\"3218\">Join the official Campus Rise WhatsApp Community:<\/strong><br data-start=\"3218\" data-end=\"3221\" \/><a href=\"https:\/\/chat.whatsapp.com\/E85adW0fCZ7Ij8k8m0bwvx\">https:\/\/chat.whatsapp.com\/E85adW0fCZ7Ij8k8m0bwvx<\/a><\/p>\n<p><strong>Certificates &amp; Recognition<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Participants who meet the event's eligibility requirements will receive a <strong data-start=\"3376\" data-end=\"3405\">Participation Certificate<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p>The <strong data-start=\"3412\" data-end=\"3432\">Top 3 performers<\/strong> will receive special recognition:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3468\" data-end=\"3591\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1n8nxg2\" data-start=\"3468\" data-end=\"3511\"><strong data-start=\"3473\" data-end=\"3484\">Rank 1:<\/strong> Special Winner Certificate<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1e9qpy7\" data-start=\"3512\" data-end=\"3551\"><strong data-start=\"3517\" data-end=\"3528\">Rank 2:<\/strong> Top Ranker Certificate<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"xfk327\" data-start=\"3552\" data-end=\"3591\"><strong data-start=\"3557\" data-end=\"3568\">Rank 3:<\/strong> Top Ranker Certificate<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Why Participate?<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>The <strong data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"3645\">TechMind Challenge 2026<\/strong> is an opportunity to:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3669\" data-end=\"3957\">\n<li data-section-id=\"l1ka1a\" data-start=\"3669\" data-end=\"3700\">Test your technical knowledge<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"17sx1tj\" data-start=\"3701\" data-end=\"3752\">Identify your strengths and areas for improvement<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1xtvv5c\" data-start=\"3753\" data-end=\"3797\">Revise important computer science concepts<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"9osk7e\" data-start=\"3798\" data-end=\"3866\">Challenge yourself with questions from multiple technology domains<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"18q7ky6\" data-start=\"3867\" data-end=\"3897\">Compete with fellow students<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"neu50b\" data-start=\"3898\" data-end=\"3957\">Earn recognition and a certificate for your participation<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Important Instructions<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3986\" data-end=\"4446\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1v33n7w\" data-start=\"3986\" data-end=\"4020\">Participation is <strong data-start=\"4005\" data-end=\"4019\">individual<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"jyjqna\" data-start=\"4021\" data-end=\"4113\">Participants should carefully read all event instructions before attempting the challenge.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3imjp\" data-start=\"4114\" data-end=\"4206\">Participants must join the official <strong data-start=\"4152\" data-end=\"4186\">Campus Rise WhatsApp Community<\/strong> after registration.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"p2j6to\" data-start=\"4207\" data-end=\"4334\">Ensure that the details provided during registration are accurate, as they may be used for certificate-related communication.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1e24v2f\" data-start=\"4335\" data-end=\"4446\">Participants should follow the event rules and complete the challenge within the specified time and schedule.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Challenge Yourself. Test Your Tech Knowledge. Rise with Campus Rise!<\/p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"4525\" data-end=\"4553\">Organized by Campus Rise<\/strong> &mdash; a student-focused community connecting learners with opportunities, technology, competitions, events, and career-focused resources.<\/p>","overall_prizes":"Top 3 Rankers will receive special ranker certificates.","regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":33125409,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-01T12:38:58+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-03T09:18:43+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"17gfXoJ","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":1,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":5,"checked":2,"display_title":null,"show_discussions_only_user":1,"show_reviews_only_user":1,"show_score_card":0,"players_count":16,"referral_leaderboard_show":0,"is_ad_free":0